  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "The workflow already caches dependencies via nix-community/cache-nix-action@v6 (Nix store), so the P-LIT-GHA-CACHE dependency-cache optimization is already satisfied and its contraindication \"an equivalent cache already exists\" applies; adding a second cache would be redundant. There is no matrix, so P-LIT-FAIL-FAST does not apply. P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT (bound jobs with a custom timeout) is the remaining candidate, but the available history is too limited and variable (successful runs span roughly 3-17 minutes; required-check status is unverified) to size a safe limit that preserves coverage, and imposing an unvalidated timeout risks interrupting valid slow runs. Path-filter, test-selection, build-selection, and cancel-stale patterns either would alter required-check coverage or lack verified prerequisites for this repository. No supported, coverage-preserving change is indicated.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT"]
}
